<title>USA: First Industrial buys Wisconsin warehouse.</title>
<headline>First Industrial buys Wisconsin warehouse.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-11-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Industrial Realty Trust Inc said Thursday it acquired for $2 million a 51,960-square-foot bulk warehouse in Wauwatosa, Wis., outside Milwaukee.</p>
<p>The real estate company said it now owned six industrial properties in the Milwaukee area and planned a further expansion of its portfolio there.</p>
<p>	   -- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
